<page-meta page-style="{{appThemeStyle}}" />
<view class="page nutrition-page"><view class="heading">先算需求，再安排三餐</view><view class="intro">根据身高、当前体重和活动量，估算每日热量与营养分配。</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="card">正在加载…</view><block wx:else>
<view class="card"><view class="card-title">你的基础资料</view><view class="note">请填写当前情况，不要使用目标体重。首次估算需自行确认资料。</view>
<view class="field"><text>年龄 · 岁</text><input type="number" value="{{form.age}}" data-field="age" bindinput="edit" placeholder="19～78" disabled="{{saving}}" /></view>
<view class="field"><text>身高 · cm</text><input type="digit" value="{{form.height}}" data-field="height" bindinput="edit" placeholder="例如 170" disabled="{{saving}}" /></view>
<view class="field"><text>当前体重 · kg</text><input type="digit" value="{{form.weight}}" data-field="weight" bindinput="edit" placeholder="例如 65" disabled="{{saving}}" /></view>
<picker range="{{sexNames}}" value="{{sexIndex}}" bindchange="chooseSex" disabled="{{saving}}"><view class="field"><text>代谢公式使用的生理性别</text><text>{{sexNames[sexIndex]}} ▾</text></view></picker>
<picker range="{{goalNames}}" value="{{goalIndex}}" bindchange="chooseGoal" disabled="{{saving}}"><view class="field"><text>目标</text><text>{{goalNames[goalIndex]}} ▾</text></view></picker></view>
<view class="card"><view class="card-title">日常活动和运动</view><view class="note">日常活动不含专门锻炼；运动按一周平均分配，不再叠加运动记录中的消耗。</view>
<picker range="{{activity}}" range-key="label" value="{{form.activity}}" data-field="activity" bindchange="edit" disabled="{{saving}}"><view class="field stack"><text>日常活动</text><text>{{activity[form.activity].label}} ▾</text></view></picker>
<view class="field"><text>每周运动 · 天</text><input type="number" value="{{form.days}}" data-field="days" bindinput="edit" disabled="{{saving}}" /></view>
<block wx:if="{{form.days > 0}}"><view class="field"><text>每次平均 · 分钟</text><input type="number" value="{{form.minutes}}" data-field="minutes" bindinput="edit" disabled="{{saving}}" /></view><picker range="{{intensity}}" range-key="label" value="{{form.intensity}}" data-field="intensity" bindchange="edit" disabled="{{saving}}"><view class="field stack"><text>平均运动强度</text><text>{{intensity[form.intensity].label}} ▾</text></view></picker></block>
<view class="field"><text>安排加餐</text><switch checked="{{form.snack}}" data-field="snack" bindchange="edit" disabled="{{saving}}" /></view></view>
<view class="card"><view class="note">适用于一般健康成年人。孕哺期、进食障碍或需治疗饮食（如肾病等）不使用此通用估算。</view><radio-group bindchange="suitable"><label><radio value="adult" checked="{{form.suitability === 'adult'}}" disabled="{{saving}}" />我符合上述适用范围</label></radio-group></view>
<view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><button class="btn-primary" bindtap="generate" disabled="{{saving}}">生成每日营养计划</button>
<view wx:if="{{result}}" id="nutrition-result"><view class="card result-card"><view class="card-title">每日参考目标</view><view class="calories">{{result.calories}}<text> kcal / 天</text></view><view class="macros"><view><text>蛋白质 · 25%</text><view>{{result.protein}} g</view></view><view><text>碳水 · 45%</text><view>{{result.carb}} g</view></view><view><text>脂肪 · 30%</text><view>{{result.fat}} g</view></view></view><view class="note">比例为通用起始方案，并非唯一最佳比例；克数四舍五入后，热量可能有少量误差。</view></view>
<view class="card"><view class="card-title">每天怎么分配</view><view wx:for="{{result.meals}}" wx:key="name" class="meal"><view class="meal-title">{{item.name}} · {{item.calories}} kcal <text>{{item.percent}}%</text></view><view class="note">蛋白质 {{item.protein}} g · 碳水 {{item.carb}} g · 脂肪 {{item.fat}} g</view></view><view class="note">这是营养目标，不是已吃下的食物，也不会自动计入饮食记录。</view></view>
<view class="card"><view class="card-title">估算依据</view><view class="note">静息代谢约 {{result.resting}} kcal × 日常活动系数 {{result.factor}} ＋ 运动日均净消耗约 {{result.movement}} kcal。维持热量约 {{result.maintenance}} kcal；{{result.adjustment}}。</view><view wx:if="{{result.floorApplied}}" class="note">本次估算触及保守下限，已上调目标，建议咨询营养师确认。</view><view class="note">运动强度、活动系数和目标调整幅度是简化估算。参考执行 2～4 周，结合体重趋势、饥饿感和训练恢复再调整，不因单日体重变化大幅减少饮食。</view><button size="mini" bindtap="copySources">查看依据链接</button></view>
<button class="btn-primary" bindtap="apply" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{saving || saved}}">{{saved ? '已应用每日目标' : '确认并应用每日目标'}}</button><view class="note footer">应用后更新首页与饮食页的热量目标及营养目标。计算资料保存在本机，目标保存在你的账号中。</view></view></block></view>
